"# 🛠️ Reverse Engineering: Action Space & DOM Pruning

> **Objective:** Reduce DOM representation from 100,000+ tokens to <2,000 tokens while preserving full interactive accuracy for F.R.I.D.A.Y.'s Agentica browser.

---

## 1. The Bottleneck
Sending full HTML dumps to an LLM:
- Consumes massive context window limits.
- Increases API cost exponentially.
- Causes hallucinated clicks because the LLM gets confused by nested `<div>` wrappers and invisible CSS elements.

---

## 2. Reverse-Engineered Pruning Algorithm

```javascript
// Injected into target webpage by Agentica / Playwright
function getInteractiveTree() {
  const elements = document.querySelectorAll(
    'a, button, input, select, textarea, [role="button"], [onclick], [tabindex="0"]'
  );

  const cleanList = [];
  let index = 1;

  elements.forEach((el) => {
    const rect = el.getBoundingClientRect();
    // Verify element is physically visible in viewport
    if (rect.width > 0 && rect.height > 0 && window.getComputedStyle(el).visibility !== 'hidden') {
      // Create visual overlay badge
      const badge = document.createElement('div');
      badge.innerText = index;
      badge.style.position = 'absolute';
      badge.style.left = `${rect.left + window.scrollX}px`;
      badge.style.top = `${rect.top + window.scrollY}px`;
      badge.style.backgroundColor = '#ff0055';
      badge.style.color = '#ffffff';
      badge.style.fontSize = '12px';
      badge.style.fontWeight = 'bold';
      badge.style.padding = '1px 4px';
      badge.style.borderRadius = '3px';
      badge.style.zIndex = '999999';
      badge.className = 'friday-marker';
      document.body.appendChild(badge);

      cleanList.push({
        index: index,
        tag: el.tagName.toLowerCase(),
        type: el.type || '',
        text: (el.innerText || el.placeholder || el.ariaLabel || '').trim().slice(0, 50),
        selector: getUniqueSelector(el)
      });
      index++;
    }
  });

  return cleanList;
}
```

